Ellersby Kinnaird accepts Item 4 with respect to the accounts identified in=
 Schedule A to this letter, which is the staff's schedule of 96 accounts as=
 reconciled against our billing system and expanded to 103 accounts. Seven =
accounts were opened after the staff's sample was drawn and are included fo=
r completeness.<br />
<br />
